# Harness: regenerable review diff packages. Everything else the harness writes is tracked
# on purpose — a ledger a second person cannot read is not a ledger.
*.diff

# SDD scratch: briefs, reports, reviews and the ledger for a running plan.
/.superpowers/

# Machine-specific: a local absolute path that differs per contributor's checkout. Committing
# it would make every contributor fight over this line on every pull; each generates their own.
.claude/settings.local.json
